#: ../../../source/The-ROS2-Project/Adopters/Add-Your-Project.rst:2
msgid "Add Your Project"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/The-ROS2-Project/Adopters/Add-Your-Project.rst:4
msgid ""
"Use the form below to generate the YAML entry for your organization or "
"project. Once generated, you can copy the YAML snippet and submit a pull "
"request to the `adopters.yaml <https://github.com/ros2/ros2_documentation/"
"blob/rolling/source/The-ROS2-Project/Adopters/adopters.yaml>`__ file on the "
"``rolling`` branch."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/The-ROS2-Project/Adopters/Add-Your-Project.rst:10
msgid "Policy"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/The-ROS2-Project/Adopters/Add-Your-Project.rst:12
msgid ""
"This list is **self-reported and self-attested**. Entries are accepted with "
"minimal scrutiny unless a complaint is received. Since contributions come "
"via Pull Request, they are easy to audit and can be cleaned up later if "
"necessary."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/The-ROS2-Project/Adopters/Add-Your-Project.rst:17
msgid "How to contribute"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/The-ROS2-Project/Adopters/Add-Your-Project.rst:19
msgid "Fill in the form below."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/The-ROS2-Project/Adopters/Add-Your-Project.rst:20
msgid "Click **Generate YAML** to produce the snippet."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/The-ROS2-Project/Adopters/Add-Your-Project.rst:21
msgid ""
"Click **Open PR on GitHub** to open the file in GitHub's web editor (the "
"YAML is copied to your clipboard automatically)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/The-ROS2-Project/Adopters/Add-Your-Project.rst:22
msgid ""
"Paste the generated YAML at the end of the ``adopters:`` list in the file."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/The-ROS2-Project/Adopters/Add-Your-Project.rst:23
msgid "Commit the change and open a pull request."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/The-ROS2-Project/Adopters/Add-Your-Project.rst:27
msgid ""
"All pull requests to the ROS 2 documentation repository require a `Developer "
"Certificate of Origin (DCO) <https://developercertificate.org/>`__ sign-off. "
"If you use the GitHub web editor, the `DCO bot <https://github.com/apps/"
"dco>`__ will comment on your PR with instructions to add the sign-off if it "
"is missing. To sign off via the command line, use ``git commit --signoff``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/The-ROS2-Project/Adopters/Add-Your-Project.rst:34
msgid ""
"<div class=\"adopters-form-container\">\n"
"<form id=\"adopters-yaml-form\">\n"
"\n"
"  <div class=\"form-group\">\n"
"    <label for=\"field-organization\">Organization *</label>\n"
"    <span class=\"form-hint\">Company or institution name</span>\n"
"    <input type=\"text\" id=\"field-organization\" placeholder=\"e.g., Acme "
"Robotics Inc.\">\n"
"  </div>\n"
"\n"
"  <div class=\"form-group\">\n"
"    <label for=\"field-organization-url\">Organization URL</label>\n"
"    <span class=\"form-hint\">Optional</span>\n"
"    <input type=\"url\" id=\"field-organization-url\" placeholder=\"https://"
"www.example.com\">\n"
"  </div>\n"
"\n"
"  <div class=\"form-group\">\n"
"    <label for=\"field-project\">Project *</label>\n"
"    <span class=\"form-hint\">The specific project using ROS</span>\n"
"    <input type=\"text\" id=\"field-project\" placeholder=\"e.g., Autonomous "
"Forklift\">\n"
"  </div>\n"
"\n"
"  <div class=\"form-group\">\n"
"    <label for=\"field-project-url\">Project URL</label>\n"
"    <span class=\"form-hint\">Optional</span>\n"
"    <input type=\"url\" id=\"field-project-url\" placeholder=\"https://www."
"example.com/project\">\n"
"  </div>\n"
"\n"
"  <div class=\"form-group\">\n"
"    <label>Domain * <span class=\"form-hint\">(select one or more)</span></"
"label>\n"
"    <div class=\"domain-checkboxes\">\n"
"      <label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"domain\" value=\"Agriculture\"> "
"Agriculture</label>\n"
"      <label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"domain\" value=\"Aerial/"
"Drone\"> Aerial/Drone</label>\n"
"      <label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"domain\" value=\"Automotive\"> "
"Automotive</label>\n"
"      <label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"domain\" value=\"Components\"> "
"Components</label>\n"
"      <label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"domain\" "
"value=\"Construction\"> Construction</label>\n"
"      <label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"domain\" value=\"Consumer "
"Robot\"> Consumer Robot</label>\n"
"      <label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"domain\" value=\"Defense/"
"Government\"> Defense/Government</label>\n"
"      <label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"domain\" value=\"Education\"> "
"Education</label>\n"
"      <label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"domain\" value=\"Energy\"> "
"Energy</label>\n"
"      <label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"domain\" value=\"Healthcare/"
"Medical\"> Healthcare/Medical</label>\n"
"      <label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"domain\" value=\"Humanoid\"> "
"Humanoid</label>\n"
"      <label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"domain\" value=\"Logistics/"
"Warehouse\"> Logistics/Warehouse</label>\n"
"      <label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"domain\" "
"value=\"Manufacturing\"> Manufacturing</label>\n"
"      <label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"domain\" value=\"Marine\"> "
"Marine</label>\n"
"      <label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"domain\" value=\"Research\"> "
"Research</label>\n"
"      <label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"domain\" value=\"Space\"> "
"Space</label>\n"
"      <label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"domain\" value=\"Service "
"Robot\"> Service Robot</label>\n"
"    </div>\n"
"  </div>\n"
"\n"
"  <div class=\"form-group\">\n"
"    <label for=\"field-date-added\">Date Added *</label>\n"
"    <span class=\"form-hint\">Auto-generated (YYYY-MM-DD)</span>\n"
"    <input type=\"text\" id=\"field-date-added\" readonly style=\"width: "
"120px; background: #e9ecef;\">\n"
"  </div>\n"
"\n"
"  <div class=\"form-group\">\n"
"    <label for=\"field-country\">Country *</label>\n"
"    <span class=\"form-hint\">Select one or more countries</span>\n"
"    <div style=\"display: flex; gap: 0.5rem; align-items: center; flex-wrap: "
"wrap;\">\n"
"      <select id=\"field-country\" style=\"width: 280px;\">\n"
"        <option value=\"\">-- Select a country --</option>\n"
"      </select>\n"
"      <button type=\"button\" id=\"adopters-add-country-btn\" class=\"btn "
"btn-secondary\" style=\"margin-top: 0;\">Add</button>\n"
"    </div>\n"
"    <div id=\"adopters-selected-countries\" class=\"adopters-country-"
"tags\"></div>\n"
"  </div>\n"
"\n"
"  <div class=\"form-group\">\n"
"    <label for=\"field-description\">Description *</label>\n"
"    <span class=\"form-hint\">Brief explanation of how you use ROS</span>\n"
"    <textarea id=\"field-description\" placeholder=\"e.g., Autonomous "
"navigation for warehouse logistics using ROS 2 and Nav2.\"></textarea>\n"
"  </div>\n"
"\n"
"  <div id=\"adopters-form-errors\" style=\"display: none;\"></div>\n"
"\n"
"  <button type=\"button\" id=\"adopters-generate-btn\" class=\"btn btn-"
"primary\">Generate YAML</button>\n"
"  <button type=\"button\" id=\"adopters-copy-btn\" class=\"btn btn-"
"secondary\" style=\"display: none;\">Copy to Clipboard</button>\n"
"  <button type=\"button\" id=\"adopters-open-pr-btn\" class=\"btn btn-"
"success\" style=\"display: none;\">Open PR on GitHub</button>\n"
"\n"
"  <pre id=\"adopters-yaml-output\" style=\"display: none;\"></pre>\n"
"\n"
"</form>\n"
"</div>"
msgstr ""
